{"message":"I’m sorry—those charges are concerning. I can order a replacement Silver Rewards Card for suspected fraud. The current card will be cancelled automatically when the replacement order is submitted, and the new card will have a different number and CVV.

To minimize further exposure, I recommend expedited delivery, which takes 2–3 business days and costs $10 for a Silver Rewards Card. The fee will be charged to your account.

Please confirm that the replacement should be sent to 1923 Oak Park Boulevard, Detroit, MI 48226, and that you authorize the $10 expedited-delivery fee."}
